      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8e627ad1f07d2a95bfd257d6c78c26a6?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAB-6.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8e627ad1f07d2a95bfd257d6c78c26a6?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAB-6.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8e627ad1f07d2a95bfd257d6c78c26a6?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAB-6.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8e627ad1f07d2a95bfd257d6c78c26a6?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAB-6.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Aaron Birkland",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5ed02cb2dacd410c1f9e56ae",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Certain defects in an object can get past the object validation stage of Ingest, and cause errors only upon reading and deserializing from storage.  In this case, the specific defect is declaring an XML namespace outside of an inline XML datastream where that namespace is referenced.</p>\n\n<p>The sequence of events leading to the error are as follows (all occurring within the scope of ingest)<br/>\n1) Object passes validation<br/>\n2) Triples are saved to RI<br/>\n3) Object is saved to storage and registry<br/>\n4) Object is loaded from storage and deserialized for the purpose of populating FieldSearch<br/>\n5) Exception is thrown in deserialization process<br/>\n6) Rollback procedure is initiated - it is supposed to clean up RI, registry, and storage<br/>\n7) In clearing the RI, the object is read from storage to determine triples to delete<br/>\n8) Exception is thrown, cleanup process is aborted as a result.  Triples, object XML, and registry entry are intact<br/>\n9) Fedora reports failure of ingest</p>",
     "created": "06/Oct/09 7:55 PM",
     "id": "11017",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10527/comment/11017",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "5ed02cb2dacd410c1f9e56ae",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
